(7633778, 1237607, 67258, '<td valign="top">I was one of your 5s, although I did consider a 4.  A square crop or 10x8 to exclude the sky would, in my opinion, have been really beneficial.  That or invest in some graduated ND filters.  This is a ''so-nearly but so-far'' photo.  Revisit and re-shoot, and in the mean time  play around with crops and sharpening - the falls part is lovely.</td>', 'I was one of your 5s, although I did consider a 4.  A square crop or 10x8 to exclude the sky would, in my opinion, have been really beneficial.  That or invest in some graduated ND filters.  This is a ''so-nearly but so-far'' photo.  Revisit and re-shoot, and in the mean time  play around with crops and sharpening - the falls part is lovely.', '2019-06-28 09:05:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7633780, 1237778, 173844, '<td valign="top">Personal favorite of the bunch.  Festive, exhilarating, transporting, and very pretty.  If one takes the somewhat ominous clouds to heart, then this might seem like last days in Eden.  But I see it as chiming in resonance with the universe.</td>', 'Personal favorite of the bunch.  Festive, exhilarating, transporting, and very pretty.  If one takes the somewhat ominous clouds to heart, then this might seem like last days in Eden.  But I see it as chiming in resonance with the universe.', '2019-06-28 10:01:43.000000', NULL, 0),
